# Density Compare
# Tin (Sn) — real density 7.31 g/cm³. equal masses: Tin vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Tin Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.3mm color: #668080 at (-20mm, 5.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 58.3 g — the water cube is the reference
